---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
import { getWriting, url } from '../lib/posts';

const recent = (await getWriting()).slice(0, 5);
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="post-body">
    <p>
      I'm a research engineer working on <strong>language model post-training</strong>. Most of my time goes
      into <strong>reinforcement learning for LLMs on non-verifiable tasks</strong> and into <strong>interpretability</strong>:
      understanding what training actually changes inside a model, not just what it changes on a benchmark.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most recently, I was a core contributor to <strong>Pipsqueak 3</strong>, Character.AI's flagship and
      highest-traffic model. I developed the main techniques used in its training, including new approaches
      for <strong>cross-tokenizer distillation</strong> and an interpretability-inspired method that decomposes a
      reward model into hand-picked, aligned features for RL.
    </p>

    <h3>Research interests</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>RL for language models:</strong> reward modeling, policy optimization, and what goes wrong in between</li>
      <li><strong>Preference learning:</strong> exploring new methods for reward modeling on preference datasets, like distributional preference learning</li>
      <li><strong>Mechanistic interpretability:</strong> parameter decomposition and causal transcoders</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Currently</h3>
    <p>
      I'm working on post-training at <strong>Disney</strong>, following its acquihire of Character.AI. You can
      reach me at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1 font-sans text-[14px]">
    {
      SITE.links.map((link) => (
        <a href={link.href} class="text-link no-underline hover:underline">
          {link.label}
        </a>
      ))
    }
  </p>

  {
    recent.length > 0 && (
      <section class="mt-14">
        <h2 class="mb-4 font-sans text-[13px] tracking-wide text-faint uppercase">Writing</h2>
        <PostList items={recent} compact />
        <a href={url('blog')} class="mt-3 inline-block font-sans text-[14px] text-muted no-underline hover:text-link">
          All posts →
        </a>
      </section>
    )
  }
</BaseLayout>
